IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ACCOUNT-PROC.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 ACCOUNT-RECORD.
   05 ACCOUNT-NUMBER     PIC 9(10).
   05 ACCOUNT-BALANCE    PIC S9(10)V99.
   05 ACCOUNT-OWNER      PIC X(50).
   05 TRANSACTION-AMOUNT PIC S9(8)V99.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-LOGIC.
    PERFORM PROCESS-DEPOSIT.
    PERFORM PROCESS-WITHDRAWAL.
    PERFORM GENERATE-REPORT.
    STOP RUN.

PROCESS-DEPOSIT.
    ADD TRANSACTION-AMOUNT TO ACCOUNT-BALANCE.
    DISPLAY "Deposit processed for account " ACCOUNT-NUMBER.

PROCESS-WITHDRAWAL.
    SUBTRACT TRANSACTION-AMOUNT FROM ACCOUNT-BALANCE.
    DISPLAY "Withdrawal processed for account " ACCOUNT-NUMBER.

GENERATE-REPORT.
    DISPLAY "Account Balance Report: " ACCOUNT-BALANCE.